      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        115.318603515625,
        174.50701904296875,
        478.95697021484375,
        189.81602478027344
      ],
      "text": "Recommended regimen for children and infants starting ART while on TB  treatment b c",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Bold",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.03939819335938,
        191.64649963378906,
        464.629638671875,
        205.74949645996094
      ],
      "text": "Younger than 3 years 2 NRTIs + NVP ensuring that dose is 200 mg/m 2",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        271.5893859863281,
        202.4464874267578,
        319.78460693359375,
        216.5494842529297
      ],
      "text": "or",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        271.5893859863281,
        213.24647521972656,
        398.3318786621094,
        227.34947204589844
      ],
      "text": "Triple NRTI (AZT + 3TC + ABC) d",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.0413818359375,
        288.0428466796875,
        461.0654296875,
        302.14593505859375
      ],
      "text": "Younger than 3  Continue NVP ensuring that dose is 200 mg/m Child on standard  2",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.0413818359375,
        298.84283447265625,
        279.75238037109375,
        312.94940185546875
      ],
      "text": "years NNRTI-based  or",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.0413818359375,
        309.64288330078125,
        398.3318786621094,
        323.7493896484375
      ],
      "text": "regimen Triple NRTI (AZT + 3TC + ABC) d",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.0413818359375,
        320.44287109375,
        163.11135864257812,
        334.5458984375
      ],
      "text": "(2 NRTIs + EFV or",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        89.0413818359375,
        327.74542236328125,
        405.6308288574219,
        345.34588623046875
      ],
      "text": "3 years and older If on EFV, continue same regimen NVP)",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        271.5848083496094,
        344.5484313964844,
        371.81781005859375,
        358.6514587402344
      ],
      "text": "If on NVP, change to EFV",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        271.5848083496094,
        355.3484191894531,
        279.747802734375,
        369.4514465332031
      ],
      "text": "or",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        271.5848083496094,
        366.1484069824219,
        398.3318786621094,
        380.2514343261719
      ],
      "text": "Triple NRTI (AZT + 3TC + ABC) d",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.6063003540039,
        628.2904663085938,
        512.438232421875,
        640.2904663085938
      ],
      "text": "a \t Abbreviations used: ABC abacavir; AZT zidovudine; EFV efavirenz; LPV/r lopinavir/ritonavir; NNRTI non-nucleoside",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        99.78230285644531,
        637.8905029296875,
        471.5184020996094,
        649.8905029296875
      ],
      "text": "reverse-transcriptase inhibitor; NRTI nucleoside reverse-transcriptase inhibitor; RTV ritonavir; 3TC lamivudine",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.6063003540039,
        650.4905395507812,
        383.9903259277344,
        662.4905395507812
      ],
      "text": "b \t Ensure optimized dosing of rifampicin based on new dosing guidelines (Chapter 4).",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.6063003540039,
        663.0905151367188,
        453.0223693847656,
        675.0905151367188
      ],
      "text": "c \t Switch to age-appropriate ART regimen based on national first-line ART at termination of TB treatment.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.6063003540039,
        675.6904907226562,
        512.50244140625,
        687.6904907226562
      ],
      "text": "d \t Triple NRTI is recommended only for the duration of TB treatment; an age-appropriate PI- or NNRTI-based regimen",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        99.78230285644531,
        685.29052734375,
        512.510498046875,
        697.29052734375
      ],
      "text": "should be restarted at termination of rifampicin-based therapy. Based on findings from the ARROW trial (15) this regimen",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        99.78230285644531,
        694.8905639648438,
        512.3984375,
        706.8905639648438
      ],
      "text": "should be considered as the preferred option for children less than 3 years on LPV/r-based regimen when starting TB",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        99.78230285644531,
        704.4905395507812,
        512.5021362304688,
        716.4905395507812
      ],
      "text": "treatment. It should also be considered as the preferred regimen for children older than 3 years with history of NNRTI",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        99.78230285644531,
        714.0905151367188,
        122.0143051147461,
        726.0905151367188
      ],
      "text": "failure.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.6063003540039,
        726.6905517578125,
        307.90234375,
        738.6905517578125
      ],
      "text": "e \t Increase RTV until same dose as LPV in mg, in a ratio of 1:1.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.6063003540039,
        739.29052734375,
        512.4862670898438,
        751.29052734375
      ],
      "text": "f \t Change to EFV should be considered as the preferred option (16) and EFV could be maintained after termination of TB",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        99.78230285644531,
        750.0905151367188,
        421.97430419921875,
        762.0905151367188
      ],
      "text": "treatment to allow simplification and harmonization with ARVs regimen in use in older children.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        14.202799797058105,
        805.8439331054688,
